# No environment variables are required for this project.
# The dev server (npm run dev) automatically adds noindex via import.meta.env.DEV.
# Production builds (npm run build) are always indexable.

# Optional — WebMCP (astro-webmcp) production activation.
# Chrome 149+ enables navigator.modelContext for real visitors only when this
# origin trial token is present; without it, WebMCP tools still work locally
# via chrome://flags/#enable-webmcp-testing. Register the deployed origin at
# https://developer.chrome.com/origintrials/#/register_trial/4163014905550602241
# and paste the resulting token below. Tokens are origin-bound and expire
# every 6-12 weeks.
# WEBMCP_ORIGIN_TRIAL_TOKEN=
